# Services are singletons with a flat property surface and, without exception,
# an `available` flag. They may never import ui/ — the dependency runs one way.
#
# Registered here because Quickshell loads through a virtual filesystem, where
# QML's implicit same-folder rule does not apply. See common/qmldir.
singleton Compositor 1.0 Compositor.qml
singleton Niri 1.0 Niri.qml
singleton Power 1.0 Power.qml
singleton Audio 1.0 Audio.qml
singleton Media 1.0 Media.qml
singleton Notifications 1.0 Notifications.qml
singleton Brightness 1.0 Brightness.qml
singleton Wallpaper 1.0 Wallpaper.qml
singleton Ical 1.0 Ical.qml
singleton Calendar 1.0 Calendar.qml
singleton Weather 1.0 Weather.qml
singleton Location 1.0 Location.qml
